From: AuraLite-Crypto maintainers <maintainers@auralite.local>
Subject: [PATCH] N2: gossipsub topics, message signatures, dedup, and peer scoring

Base: N1 (patches/0041-N1-transport.patch on GitHub main 2cf0321a83d6b308950a196b476ab086bf50c42c).

---
